      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\",\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\",\"(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5317b78954fd3827c16f4a207a33ff861de96d50a62c6e62daa8754b8ad13dd2\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a242c0a307f70294ce0e4e9903eaf4e1ba44d83f096cb59115ba72fadde50490\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:698521d32064951baece173f1bd4290f16494b5c7f8342ef2955e20510b70b54\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:73d4af4d82df4c78fe248a0636df379a1bde2caffcfd949cd0254a10ecdf8788\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4a825b98f89225d3834bd2086552d610daa522af10b6139501f636372e5812e9\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:78c5228ba6c59180a614199e7b123d838ad8b75d7f9ff06042aa758d7e27cb6c\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:dd08d6f6ad7d2756194dd41257229b90faf76c7d8add5801d6a58e682d3227c3\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5ea7035cfc250bd5932b321b21316258f4ca74f0f75bd7bcccfa08dda912a2b1\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:cb797ae4ceb898842b041cc5b48d293f48f4eb49958ad51d7a2af7e88923eb18\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"choice_text\":\"An eligible employee must satisfy all three criteria: (1) has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months; AND (2) has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave (subject to special rules for airline flight crew employees in § 825.801); AND (3) is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite (referencing § 825.105(b) for employees working outside the U.S.).\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":590,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A17e50019a4e77ab1a9c73c9fab8bd1b6da871d60b60c77790e8803a1d9920f62:37:590:sha256-e43d03081e43a5cd56466e06b1489af91ab5a4d901b3a2068f64e68e4fa8e5dd\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A17e50019a4e77ab1a9c73c9fab8bd1b6da871d60b60c77790e8803a1d9920f62:105:590:sha256-a4146cb35aab2ea08ee13739825b1cfce51ae8